                           xmi:id="_2024x_3_71e0233_1771845057787_217224_23501"
                           body="A specialized [[Organizer]] with elements displayed in two or three dimensions such as a model-diagram, 3D visualization or pie-chart. Any element SHOULD reference any instance of [[Entity]] or [[Relationship]]. ">
