                           xmi:id="_2024x_3_71e0233_1771846391885_247569_23524"
                           body="A [[Link]] subclass for use by [[Relationship]] to enumerate eligible [[Entity]] and/or [[Relationship]] classes that can serve as a source.&#xA;&#xA;Example:&#xA;- By further specializing this class, a speaking title can be given to a sourceLink, such as 'employee' in a 'worksFor' relationship being a specialization of [[Relationship]].">
               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_2024x_3_71e0233_1771835422007_928561_22405"/>
            </ownedComment>
