                           xmi:id="_2024x_3_71e0233_1757681317013_16801_20533"
                           body="Indicates which type of element (including organizer, entity and relationship) is eligible for a given type of organizer. For example, an organizer (folder) named *Requirements* may reference all entities named *Requirement* or an organizer (diagram) named *Functjonal Decomposition* may reference all entities named *Function*.">
