      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package"
                        xmi:id="_2026x_14400d4_1785161422039_37620_18465"
                        name="CASCaRA Schemata">
         <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment"
                        xmi:id="_2026x_14400d4_1785161504415_598493_18466"
                        body="Schemata are (resp. will be) made available for the native CASCaRA formats; they are 'Platform Specific Models' (PSM) in OMG terms:&#xA;- JSON-Schema for [CASCaRA JSON-LD](https://product-information-graph.org/schema/latest/jsonld/).&#xA;- XML-Schema (XSD) for CASCaRA XML *(in preparation)*&#xA;- RDF *(in preparation, while it is not yet clear how to formulate the CASCaRA metamodel and its constraints in SPARQL, SHACL or other)*.&#xA;&#xA;Note: Schemata can only check the *format* of a data-set. Constraints apply in addition. Please refer to the Metamodel chapter above.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_2026x_14400d4_1785161422039_37620_18465"/>
         </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package"
                        xmi:id="_2026x_14400d4_1785161655494_802557_18467"
                        name="CASCaRA Example">
         <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment"
                        xmi:id="_2026x_14400d4_1785400431184_531190_42828"
                        body="A simple, yet representative CASCaRA example is presented. This chapter decribes it, whereas the data is listed in the four native CASCaRA formats:&#xA;- CASCaRA XML, see Annex A.1 or [Very Simple Model with Requirements (XML)](https://github.com/GfSE/CASCaDE-Verification-and-Validation/blob/main/Very-simple-Model-with-Requirements%20%5BFMC%20-%20SpecIF%5D/5_XML/Very%20Simple%20Model%20(FMC)%20with%20Requirements.cas.xml).&#xA;- CASCaRA JSON-LD, see Annex A.2 or [Very Simple Model with Requirements (JSON-LD)](https://github.com/GfSE/CASCaDE-Verification-and-Validation/blob/main/Very-simple-Model-with-Requirements%20%5BFMC%20-%20SpecIF%5D/6_JSONLD/Very_Simple_Model_(FMC)_with_Requirements.cas.jsonld).&#xA;- CASCaRA XML, see Annex A.3 or [Very Simple Model with Requirements (RDF/Turtle)](https://github.com/GfSE/CASCaDE-Verification-and-Validation/blob/main/Very-simple-Model-with-Requirements%20%5BFMC%20-%20SpecIF%5D/7_TTL/Very_Simple_Model_(FMC)_with_Requirements.cas.ttl).&#xA;- CASCaRA Cypher, see Annex A.4 or [Very Simple Model with Requirements (Cypher)](https://github.com/GfSE/CASCaDE-Verification-and-Validation/blob/main/Very-simple-Model-with-Requirements%20%5BFMC%20-%20SpecIF%5D/4_Cypher/Very%20Simple%20Model%20(FMC)%20with%20Requirements.cypher). As soon as implementations of GQL exist, the example will be provided in that format, as well.&#xA;">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_2026x_14400d4_1785161655494_802557_18467"/>
         </ownedComment>
